{"name":"Sophisticated Teal","hex":"#537175","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sophisticated","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a person: having obtained worldly experience, and lacking naiveté; cosmopolitan, worldly-wise.","Of art or other things: appealing to the tastes of an intellectual or sophisticated (sense 1) person; cerebral; also, cultured, elegant, refined."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of sophisticate"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sophisticated"},{"term":"teal","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various small freshwater ducks of the genus Anas that are brightly coloured and have short necks.","A dark, somewhat bluish-green colour; a dark cyan."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a bluish-green colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/teal"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sophistication","blocks":[{"text":"Sophistication refers to the qualities of refinement, good taste, and wisdom. By contrast, its original use was as a pejorative, derived from sophist, and included the idea of admixture or adulteration. Today, as researched by Faye Hammill, it is common as a measure of refinement—displaying good taste, wisdom and subtlety rather than crudeness, stupidity and vulgarity."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Greta_Garbo_Anna_Karenina_4.jpg/330px-Greta_Garbo_Anna_Karenina_4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sophistication"},{"title":"Teal","blocks":[{"text":"Teal is a dark cyan color. Its name comes from that of a bird, the Eurasian teal which has a similarly colored stripe on its head. The word is often used colloquially to refer to shades of cyan in general."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Smithsonian_-_NMAAHC_-_Teal_blue_dress_and_cropped_jacket_designed_by_Ann_Lowe-_NMAAHC_201